e/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T11:34:56-08:00","id":1358664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1088486-mage-booklist?p=1337951#post1337951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not confirmed or released but, that <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1336887-deviant-kickstarter?p=1337950#post1337950&amp;quot;]Clade</a> Companion in the Deviant KS looks pretty useful.[/URL]</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019ll wait until I get a chance to check it out before adding it to the list. I suspect you are right though. Deviants make such delicious Mysteries.<br /> <br /> On a more current note, I realized I find Actual Plays very useful for grounding and inspiring my campaigns, so I\u2019m going to add some to my various book lists. Luckily, Mage is an easy place to start since it has two actual play \u2014 The Broken Pentacle and The Soul Cage \u2014 by this Dave Brookshaw guy. You might have heard of him. <br /> <br /> If you haven\u2019t read them yet, links are at the bottom of the first post. If there are any others worthy of inclusion, let me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T14:17:34-08:00","id":1358699,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1088486-mage-booklist?p=1358664#post1358664\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019ll wait until I get a chance to check it out before adding it to the list. I suspect you are right though. Deviants make such delicious Mysteries.<br /> <br /> On a more current note, I realized I find Actual Plays very useful for grounding and inspiring my campaigns, so I\u2019m going to add some to my various book lists. Luckily, Mage is an easy place to start since it has two actual play \u2014 The Broken Pentacle and The Soul Cage \u2014 by this Dave Brookshaw guy. You might have heard of him. <br /> <br /> If you haven\u2019t read them yet, links are at the bottom of the first post. If there are any others worthy of inclusion, let me know.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dave also did a pretty good one shot called Bleak House, which is even referenced in Soul Cage: <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/actual-play-mage-the-awakening-bleak-house.316806/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...-house.316806/</a><br /> <br /> There is also one by Azezel called The Voice of Freedom that I found really interesting:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/mage-the-awakening-the-voice-of-freedom.408237/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...reedom.408237/</a><br /> <br /> There is also Dave's ongoing AP, called The Man comes around, which is terrific so far:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/mage-the-awakening-the-man-comes-around.591295/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...around.591295/</a><br /> <br /> Lastly, if I may take the opportunity, I wanted to ask a question. The mage merch pinned topic reminded me that it would be awesome if there was a Mage GM screen. But that thread is closed, is there anywhere to suggest that ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T14:20:01-08:00","id":1358702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1088486-mage-booklist?p=1358699#post1358699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dave also did a pretty good one shot called Bleak House, which is even referenced in Soul Cage:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/actual-play-mage-the-awakening-bleak-house.316806/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...-house.316806/</a><br /> <br /> There is also one by Azezel called The Voice of Freedom that I found really interesting:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/mage-the-awakening-the-voice-of-freedom.408237/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...reedom.408237/</a><br /> <br /> There is also Dave's ongoing AP, called The Man comes around, which is terrific so far:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/mage-the-awakening-the-man-comes-around.591295/\" target=\"_blank\">https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?thre...around.591295/</a><br /> <br /> Lastly, if I may take the opportunity, I wanted to ask a question. The mage merch pinned topic reminded me that it would be awesome if there was a Mage GM screen. But that thread is closed, is there anywhere to suggest that ?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh wonderful, I will add those, thank you! I'm not sure about a Mage Screen, but I would start by asking about it in next Monday's Notes and see where it goes from there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" ta